# Damage dealt to a creature by a source with infect causes that source's controller to put that many -1/-1 counters on
# it (CR 120.3d, 702.90c), so "If you would put one or more counters" (Innkeeper's Talent, level 3) is the infect creature's
# controller's, even in combat, where the damage is a turn-based action's (CR 510.2). Bot2's Ornithopter blocks Bot1's
# Glistener Elf and gets two -1/-1 counters for 1 damage, and dies. (The Talent's level-1 trigger puts its counters on
# Bot1's Ornithopter.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Innkeeper's Talent
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Glistener Elf
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

